$$ \sigma_{i'j'} = \sum_k \sum_l L_{i'k} L_{j'l} \sigma_{k_l} $
Since the conductivity is a matrix, we can use the relation:
$$ \mathbf{J}' = \mathbf{\sigma}' \mathbf{E}'$
